  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d R&#xf6;de Kors Nordisk United World College 201</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Red Cross Nordic United World College 2011 - Support Red Cross Nordic Unite</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Driftst&#xf6;d till R&#xf6;de Kors Nordisk United World College under  f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning att UWC fortsatt tar emot svenska elever i samma utstr&#xe4;ckning som f&#xf6;rut samt att UWC aktivt verkar f&#xf6;r en j&#xe4;mnare kostnadsf&#xf6;rdelning mellan de nordiska l&#xe4;nderna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The core support to Red Cross Nordic United World College is conditioned to continued acceptance/lodging of sstudents from Sweden as before and that UWC actively will work for a better costsharing between the nordic countries.</narrative>
  </description>
